---
/**
 * Small, factual service-boundary disclosure using the existing Virex tokens.
 * SMS credits and Sender ID approval are not entitlements of Core plans.
 */
---
<aside aria-label="MarkChat service and billing information" class="border-y border-border bg-surface/40">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-4 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between gap-3">
    <div>
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-text">One platform family. Two separate billing models.</p>
      <p class="text-xs text-text-muted leading-relaxed mt-1">
        MarkChat Core plans cover recurring workspace access. MarkChat SMS Studio uses separately purchased prepaid KES credits and carrier-approved Sender IDs. Core federation is pending.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-xs font-semibold shrink-0">
      <a href="/pricing" class="text-primary hover:underline focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-primary">Core subscriptions</a>
      <a href="/docs/sms-gateway" class="text-primary hover:underline focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-primary">SMS Studio policy</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</aside>
